⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of The Katayanagi Twins
node SPW · SPW · ⟦The Katayanagi Twins:SPW:cf5fea⟧

WHO   — The Katayanagi Twins — the robot-summoning DJs
WHAT  — The synth-wielding bosses who summon giant musical dragons from their amplifiers, fought not with fists but with a literal battle of the bands.
WHERE — SPW · Scott Pilgrim vs. the World  Framework inputs: Scott Pilgrim vs. the World (2010); O'Malley's graphic novels  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because some rivals attack only through what they make; because the loudest fight in the film has no punches at all.
HOW   — By keytars, towers of amplifiers, and twin robot dragons conjured out of sheer electronic noise.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  We don't throw a single punch — we summon the dragons and let the synths do the fighting.

